    "name": "Angels & Demons",
    "steam_appid": 2198290,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/a06d11c3f6af131f88df11febc36e703.poster.avif?t=1737835955\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/a06d11c3f6af131f88df11febc36e703.webm?t=1737835955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/a06d11c3f6af131f88df11febc36e703.mp4?t=1737835955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Angels &amp; Demons is a multi-genre mash-up!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The barrier separating The Living Realm from The Spiritual Realm has been broken!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's up to you, your guardian angel Yui, and some of your friends to fix it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/c9d19d8bad5df19b262720e25d32f040.avif?t=1737835955\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/a5e31d0ba94443587f7970be2baad9a9.avif?t=1737835955\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the overworld, you can make use of all kinds of different abilities. Some shared, and some unique to specific characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel the world on your quest to save the world from demons of The Seven Deadly Sins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/d0b658069930fe89a578f8a50a3e5977.poster.avif?t=1737835955\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/d0b658069930fe89a578f8a50a3e5977.webm?t=1737835955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/d0b658069930fe89a578f8a50a3e5977.mp4?t=1737835955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight off enemies in turn-based battles! Each character has their own unique set of strengths, weaknesses, and special attacks! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/43035439521b7e3039e653276bb7e26d.poster.avif?t=1737835955\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/43035439521b7e3039e653276bb7e26d.webm?t=1737835955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/43035439521b7e3039e653276bb7e26d.mp4?t=1737835955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But when the enemy has a chance to attack, you'll have to dodge using one of multiple different &quot;Attack Styles!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With 14 different attack styles, there's TONS of variety in enemy attacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/d4bd45ba64da73683bb48fccfecef2cf.poster.avif?t=1737835955\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/d4bd45ba64da73683bb48fccfecef2cf.webm?t=1737835955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/d4bd45ba64da73683bb48fccfecef2cf.mp4?t=1737835955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Oh yeah, this is a rhythm game too!</h2></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tons of overworld elements sync to the music, certain attacks are music synced too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There's also a full-on mania-style rhythm game featuring 20 different tracks, each with four different difficulties!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Difficulties friendly to beginners and experts alike!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/bb53a011784701ce0c5b8154d475983b.poster.avif?t=1737835955\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/bb53a011784701ce0c5b8154d475983b.webm?t=1737835955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/bb53a011784701ce0c5b8154d475983b.mp4?t=1737835955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/e669acf2563f707142534e6e25a5630c.avif?t=1737835955\" /></div>Play with your friends! 5 player local co-op! 5 player online versus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(and 4 player offline versus, because the screen would be too cramped otherwise!) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/088dcffd2a79db879af3b79f689a48f9.poster.avif?t=1737835955\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/088dcffd2a79db879af3b79f689a48f9.webm?t=1737835955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/088dcffd2a79db879af3b79f689a48f9.mp4?t=1737835955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/a06d11c3f6af131f88df11febc36e703.poster.avif?t=1737835955\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/a06d11c3f6af131f88df11febc36e703.webm?t=1737835955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/a06d11c3f6af131f88df11febc36e703.mp4?t=1737835955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Angels &amp; Demons is a multi-genre mash-up!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The barrier separating The Living Realm from The Spiritual Realm has been broken!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's up to you, your guardian angel Yui, and some of your friends to fix it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/c9d19d8bad5df19b262720e25d32f040.avif?t=1737835955\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/a5e31d0ba94443587f7970be2baad9a9.avif?t=1737835955\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the overworld, you can make use of all kinds of different abilities. Some shared, and some unique to specific characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel the world on your quest to save the world from demons of The Seven Deadly Sins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/d0b658069930fe89a578f8a50a3e5977.poster.avif?t=1737835955\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/d0b658069930fe89a578f8a50a3e5977.webm?t=1737835955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/d0b658069930fe89a578f8a50a3e5977.mp4?t=1737835955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight off enemies in turn-based battles! Each character has their own unique set of strengths, weaknesses, and special attacks! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/43035439521b7e3039e653276bb7e26d.poster.avif?t=1737835955\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/43035439521b7e3039e653276bb7e26d.webm?t=1737835955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/43035439521b7e3039e653276bb7e26d.mp4?t=1737835955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But when the enemy has a chance to attack, you'll have to dodge using one of multiple different &quot;Attack Styles!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With 14 different attack styles, there's TONS of variety in enemy attacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/d4bd45ba64da73683bb48fccfecef2cf.poster.avif?t=1737835955\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/d4bd45ba64da73683bb48fccfecef2cf.webm?t=1737835955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/d4bd45ba64da73683bb48fccfecef2cf.mp4?t=1737835955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Oh yeah, this is a rhythm game too!</h2></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tons of overworld elements sync to the music, certain attacks are music synced too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There's also a full-on mania-style rhythm game featuring 20 different tracks, each with four different difficulties!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Difficulties friendly to beginners and experts alike!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/bb53a011784701ce0c5b8154d475983b.poster.avif?t=1737835955\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/bb53a011784701ce0c5b8154d475983b.webm?t=1737835955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/bb53a011784701ce0c5b8154d475983b.mp4?t=1737835955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/e669acf2563f707142534e6e25a5630c.avif?t=1737835955\" /></div>Play with your friends! 5 player local co-op! 5 player online versus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(and 4 player offline versus, because the screen would be too cramped otherwise!) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/088dcffd2a79db879af3b79f689a48f9.poster.avif?t=1737835955\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/088dcffd2a79db879af3b79f689a48f9.webm?t=1737835955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198290/extras/088dcffd2a79db879